{
  "title": "Vibrant Smoky Saudi Arabian Lamb Kebabs",
  "description": "A flavorful and aromatic Saudi Arabian dish featuring lamb, pine nuts, and a blend of spices, perfect for a date night dinner",
  "cuisine": "Saudi Arabian",
